namespace is a partition in the memory r hardware of a system or cluster 
The advantage of namespace is that segregation of data can be made & collision of pods can be avoided
the default namespace is created by k8s automatically for general usage of small practice setups it contains pods,deployments,services , 
if u dont specify any namespace it considers to be default
the custom namespace should be created manually by user it can be given any name, used for seperating app/resources for better organization and isolation of pods
